        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-SD-DOLPHIN 10 Inch Acrylic Dolphin Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>Made in Florida, the home state of the Miami Dolphins, by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.  Available in <b>Frosted or Clear Acrylic</b> they great pulls for glass shower doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis Acrylic Dolphin is from the new <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=214719\">Nature Collection by First Impressions</a>. The mounting brackets are available in your choice of Brushed Aluminum or Polished Chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-DOLPHIN  Acrylic Dolphin Shower Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Optional Frosted or Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p><p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>",
